The kernel Open vSwitch module is unavailable for the current Jetson kernel, so this prototype uses the userspace datapath. Keep that limitation in mind when interpreting performance measurements.

## 3. Seven-switch topology

The current topology has two possible routes from S1 to S7:

Primary route

S1

