S2–S3–S4–S6–S5–S2 forms a loop. We need loop-safe forwarding before testing automatic path changes.

The inter-switch links are:

* S1–S2

* S2–S3

* S3–S4

* S4–S7

* S2–S5

* S5–S6

* S6–S4

