### D. Connectivity test

We ran:

Bash

```
sudo ip netns exec hostA ping -c 4 -W 2 10.200.0.2
```

Result: 100% packet loss, with `Destination Host Unreachable`.

That is why we investigated the learning-switch code and identified the cyclic topology as a likely cause.

